\n[RATIONALE]:\nThis fix wraps the set comprehension in parentheses, making it a valid expression as required by Alloy 6 function-body rules, and avoids the block-style or quantifier misuse that caused previous attempts to fail.\n\n[LESSON]:\nAlways ensure Alloy 6 function bodies are single expressions, not predicate-style blocks; use parentheses around set comprehensions, and properly terminate top-level declarations.\n```",
